<h1 class="heading">Event Booking Confirmation</h1>

<p class="text">
  Hi {@event.registrant_full_name}, we've received your event request.
</p>

<div class="card">
  <p class="card-title">
    {@event.occasion}
  </p>

  <p class="card-text">
    <span class="label">Type:</span>
    {@event.event_type.display_name}
  </p>

  <p class="card-text">
    <span class="label">Date:</span>
    {format_date(@event.requested)}
  </p>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <p class="card-title">Reference Number</p>

  <p class="card-text">
    <span class="label">Event ID:</span>
    {@event.id}
  </p>

  <p class="small-text muted">
    Please include this reference number in any communications about your event.
  </p>
</div>

<p class="text">
  We'll review your request, find an available time slot, and get back to you soon.
</p>

<p class="text muted italic" style="font-size: 0.875rem;">
  Please note: This inbox is not monitored. For questions, contact us directly at <a href="mailto:bookings@singhsabha.net">bookings@singhsabha.net</a>.
</p>

<div class="footer">
  <img
    src="https://singhsabha.net/images/logo.png"
    alt="Singh Sabha Logo"
    class="logo"
  />
  <p>
    <a href="https://singhsabha.net/" target="_blank">SinghSabha.net</a>, serving the Sikh community with devotion and compassion.
  </p>
</div>
